OL,3,AFirst UK charges brought over 1994
OL,4,ARwanda genocide
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Rwandan man, who has been living in
OL,7,Fnorth London, has been charged with
OL,8,Foffences relating to the 1994 genocide
OL,9,Fin Rwanda.
OL,11,FThe Crown Prosecution Service said it
OL,12,Fwas the first time charges relating to
OL,13,Fthe genocide against the Tutsi in
OL,14,FRwanda have been brought in the UK.
OL,16,FDr Vincent Brown, formerly Dr Vincent
OL,17,FBajinya, 65, has been charged with one
OL,18,Foffence of conduct ancillary to
OL,19,Fgenocide and six offences of conduct
OL,20,Fancillary to murder as a crime against
OL,21,Fhumanity.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
